# Cloudflare Pages rewrites (public/_redirects → dist/_redirects).
# Standalone whitelabel invoice page: serve the payment shell (built at
# /pay/) for any /account/payment/<id> URL; the client script reads the id
# from the path. The target must live OUTSIDE the splat's match — rewriting
# to a path under /account/payment/* loops on Pages' index.html normalization.
/account/payment/*  /pay/  200
